{"message":"Let’s start by ensuring your phone can access the fastest networks. Please set your network mode preference to 4G/5G preferred by running:

set_network_mode_preference(mode="4g_5g_preferred")

Once you’ve done that, let me know and we’ll move on to the next step."}

{"message":"Great. Now please enable data roaming on your device by running:

toggle_roaming()

After you’ve done that, let me know if your mobile data connection improves."}

{"message":"Thanks! First, let’s make sure your phone is set to prefer the fastest networks. Please run the following action on your device:

set_network_mode_preference(mode="4g_5g_preferred")

Let me know once that’s done."}

{"message":"Great. Next, please disconnect any active VPN on your device by running this action:

disconnect_vpn()

Let me know once that’s completed."}
